{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55502","headline":"残丝曲 · 卢郢","name":"残丝曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风骀荡吹人衣，残丝罥花曳空飞。\n闲愁十丈断不得，雄蜂雌蝶相因依。\n高楼夹路淩云起，琐窗鸾柱弹《流水》。\n莺声啼老杨柳烟，香梦蒙蒙隔千里。\n（见清朱绪曾编《金陵诗徴》卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}